# Permanently unlock Yoshi in Delfino from the earned fifteen-Shine File B.
# The route defeats Shadow Mario, feeds and mounts Yoshi, then uses Pause > Save.
# Acceptance requires flag 0x1038F in memory and a changed, valid GCI; the paired
# cold route proves persistence. Controller inputs only; no stage start, cheats,
# direct aiming, teleportation or save edits. See docs/yoshi-gameplay.md.

mash START period=30 until stage=15 dirstate=4 timeout=6000
wait frames=240
mash A period=30 until cardmode=0 timeout=900
wait frames=30
log
